      "settings": {
        "title": "The skin you cannot see",
        "text": "<p>Your skin is home to trillions of microorganisms, and healthy skin often carries 50 to 100+ different types living in balance. Together they form your skin microbiome, a living layer that helps your skin stay balanced, comfortable and resilient-looking day to day. Differences in temperature, texture, humidity and chemistry from one part of the body to another help decide which microbes live where, and skin science looks at that variety as a marker of skin health, because a varied community is a resilient one.</p><p>Everyone has a skin microbiome, whatever their skin type, so supporting it is a foundation for every routine.</p>",
        "reverse_order": false,
        "wide_image": false,
